#: manual/tutorial/bench/bin_float.md:29
msgid "The runner executes the skipped performance tests of `src/bench/bin_float` on the native target in release mode and writes `.tmp/bench/SUITE.jsonl` (all observations) and `.tmp/bench/SUITE.analysis.txt` (the reduced lines), where `SUITE` is the name given to `just bench`."
